ong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Machine_detail_1914_(3191683040).jpg">Wikimedia Commons</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> tele<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> A telegraphone LCCN2002709528<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <a href="https://www.loc.gov/pictures/item/2002709528/">Library of Congress</a><br /> <strong>License:</strong> Public Domain<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_telegraphone_LCCN2002709528.jpg">Wikimedia Commons</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> lamp<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> Early Cooper Hewitt mercury vapor lamp<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> N/A<br /> <strong>License:</strong> Public Domain<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Early_Cooper_Hewitt_mercury_vapor_lamp.jpg">Wikimedia Commons</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> paper<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> Antique Old Texture Paper Parchment Background<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> N/A<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://www.maxpixel.net/Antique-Old-Texture-Paper-Parchment-Background-1074131">Max Pixel</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/laneous" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4894577&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606421149" alt="Laneous" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4894577)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/laneous" >Laneous</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class=