&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-3&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kind of requested in the sense that Calibri likes them and asked me if I tried it before. I didn&#039;t so here are my first limericks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;No One Expects The Spanish Decommission!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The most beautiful Spanish ship&lt;br /&gt;
Gave the economy a dip&lt;br /&gt;
Wants some silver, some gold&lt;br /&gt;
Reduced to ashes&#039; cold&lt;br /&gt;
Decommissioned, a last sea trip&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspired by: &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4456&quot;&gt;SCP-4456-D&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606421153&quot; alt=&quot;Calibri Bold&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold&quot;  &gt;Calibri Bold&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
