&lt;p&gt;Oh ma goodness! What a ton of pasta!&lt;br /&gt;
Linguini, capellini, and fettuccini&lt;br /&gt;
Mamma mia, make it stop. Please, basta!&lt;br /&gt;
Tortellini, rigatoni, and rotini&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Linguini, capellini, and fettuccini&lt;br /&gt;
Now bigoli, gigli, what is mostaccioli?&lt;br /&gt;
Tortellini, rigatoni, and rotini&lt;br /&gt;
Damn, why is this pasta so goddamn wriggly?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now bigoli, gigli, what is mostaccioli?&lt;br /&gt;
Oh, great the lose spaghetti can now talk&lt;br /&gt;
Damn, why is this pasta so goddamn wriggly?&lt;br /&gt;
I&#039;d rather Bangkok noodles in some stock&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oh, great the lose spaghetti can now talk&lt;br /&gt;
Can&#039;t we have permission to boil them all?&lt;br /&gt;
